sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Request A (tenant Alfa)
    participant P as Pooled connection
    participant D as PostgreSQL (RLS)
    participant B as Request B (forgot the tenant)
    A->>P: borrow
    A->>D: resolve_tenant(alfa, user): member?
    A->>D: BEGIN, set tenant alfa (transaction-local)
    A->>D: SELECT * FROM ledger_line
    D-->>A: Alfa's rows only (policy: tenant_id = setting)
    A->>D: COMMIT: the setting is gone
    A->>P: return
    B->>P: borrow the same connection
    B->>D: SELECT * FROM ledger_line (no tenant set)
    D-->>B: no rows (setting is empty, the policy is false)
